Description: Draw a complete interactive 'plotly.js' graphic (data
    reshaping, series, colours, labels, theme, legend, range slider) with
    a single short call, and compose plots with the '+' operator through
    the 'kplotly' S3 class. The 'plotly.js' library is embedded, so the
    package only depends on 'htmlwidgets'. Plot types, themes and palettes
    live in extensible registries.
